Because {PAWN_nameDef} regained {PAWN_possessive} sanity, {PAWN_pronoun} became rehumanized. {PAWN_objective} Inhumanized trait has been replaced with {0}.

{1}

{PAWN_nameDef} will unfortunately remain forever prone to losing {PAWN_possessive} mind once again, even more so than others. Any negative effects on sanity will be doubled, which might cause {PAWN_nameDef} to become inhumanized again.
